 upload. Customizations panel adds search and Subagents section.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://docs.devin.ai/desktop/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-08-10\",\n    \"community_feedback\": [\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"RIP Windsurf - Windsurf was a coolish brand, one I could get behind, Devin seems like anything but that\",\n        \"source\": \"Reddit\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"negative\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"Adieu Windsurf (now Devin), it's been a good run. Been using Windsurf since Aug 2025\",\n        \"source\": \"Reddit\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"neutral\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"The migration somehow uninstalls WS instead of replacing it with Devin\",\n        \"source\": \"Reddit\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"negative\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Windsurf\",\n    \"title\": \"Devin Desktop v3.6.27 - Windows certificate store support\",\n    \"description\": \"Windows version now loads root and intermediate certificates from Windows certificate store, fixing sign-in failures with self-signed certificates. Edit tools now refuse to write through symlinks for security.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"bugfix\",\n    \"url\": \"https://docs.devin.ai/desktop/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-08-01\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Aider\",\n    \"title\": \"v0.86.0 - GPT-5 and Gemini 2.5 Flash Lite support\",\n    \"description\": \"Added support for all GPT-5 models and Grok-4 via xAI and OpenRouter. Gemini 2.5 Flash Lite Preview model added. /clear command now provides confirmation message. OpenRouter MoonshotAI Kimi K2 model support. Model announcements display with no-arg /model command.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/Aider-AI/aider/releases\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-08-09\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Codex CLI\",\n    \"title\": \"Computer History for 