ort from Cursor-managed skills. Support for opt-in MCP 2026-07-28 protocol with paginated discovery.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-08-07\",\n    \"community_feedback\": [\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"Codex CLI has the largest open MCP plugin ecosystem with 9,000+ servers, plus 90+ proprietary Codex plugins\",\n        \"source\": \"Blog\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"Codex CLI is the only lab agent that's open source, OS-sandboxed, and local-model-capable all at once\",\n        \"source\": \"Blog\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"The Codex app feels like the missing IDE layer for the Codex CLI with features like one-click Xcode integration, diff reviews, and agent management\",\n        \"source\": \"OpenAI Developers Community\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Gemini CLI\",\n    \"title\": \"v0.54.0 - PR Automation and security enhancements\",\n    \"description\": \"Integrated Antigravity agent runner with dual-locking Firestore concurrency controls for PR generator. Enhanced caretaker triage to post comments prior to auto-closing issues. Prevented cleartext credential leakage by enforcing HTTPS, rotated session IDs on model fallbacks, and skipped merged function-response turns.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-08-06\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  }\n]",
