        .insight-author {\n            color: #828282;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            margin-bottom: 3px;\n        }\n\n        .insight-author a {\n            color: #828282;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        .insight-author a:hover {\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .insight-topics {\n            margin-top: 4px;\n        }\n\n        footer {\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            padding: 15px 10px;\n            text-align: center;\n            color: #828282;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            border-top: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        footer a {\n            color: #828282;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        footer a:hover {\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        /* Responsive design */\n        @media (max-width: 900px) {\n            .three-column-layout {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n\n            .column {\n                margin-bottom: 10px;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media print {\n            body {\n                background-color: #ffffff;\n            }\n\n            .column {\n                border: none;\n                page-break-inside: avoid;\n            }\n\n            .three-column-layout {\n                display: block;\n            }\n\n            .column {\n                margin-bottom: 20px;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* Scrollbar styling */\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar {\n            width: 8px;\n        }\n\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n            background: #f1f1f1;\n        }\n\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n            background: #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n            background: #b4b4b4;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <header>\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h1>Agentic Coding Research Report</h1>\n            <div class=\"date\">2026-08-15 | Daily Update on AI Coding Agents, Tools, and Technical Insights</div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"three-column-layout\">\n            <!-- New Products Section -->\n            <section class=\"column new-products\">\n                <h2>🚀 New Products (2)</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://ai.meta.com/blog/introducing-muse-spark-meta-model-api/\">Meta Muse Code</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Meta's first AI coding agent launched in beta on August 5, 2026. Powered by the Muse Spark 1.2 multimodal reasoning model, it's a terminal-based coding agent designed for agentic tasks with major gains in tool and computer use, coding, and multimodal understanding.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Released: 2026-08-05</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://ai.meta.com/blog/introducing-muse-spark-meta-model-api/\">→ Details</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\n                        \"Meta is explicitly targeting Anthropic and OpenAI's coding AI offerings\" - TechCrunch\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.alibabacloud.com/blog/alibaba-unveils-cutting-edge-ai-coding-model-qwen3-coder_602399\">Alibaba Qwen3-Coder</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Alibaba's most advanced agentic AI coding model unveiled in August 2026. Open-sourced a 2.4-trillion-parameter model built for long-running software work. Ranked #1 in APAC by Gartner Magic Quadrant for Enterprise AI Coding Agents.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding model</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Released: 2026-08-06</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.alibabacloud.com/blog/alibaba-unveils-cutting-edge-ai-coding-model-qwen3-coder_602399\">→ Details</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\n                        \"Three major launches within 72 hours (Meta, Anthropic, and Alibaba) caused a price shift in the market\" - Developer Tech\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Whitelist Updates Section -->\n            <section class=\"column whitelist-updates\">\n                <h2>🔄 Product Updates (25)</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">Claude Code</div>\n                    <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Auto mode becomes default for new sessions on Pro, Max, and Team plans. VS Code Focus view and subagent forking default. Security fixes and credential masking.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-08-14 | <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/whats-new/2026-w32\">→ Release Notes</a></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">Cursor</div>\n                    <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Cloud Agents start 3x faster with Builds. Google Workspace plugins for Gmail, Drive, and Calendar integration.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-08-13 | <a href=\"https://cursor.com/blog/builds\">→ Release Notes</a></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">GitHub Copilot</div>\n                    <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Grok 4.6 and Gemini 3.7 Flash models available. Agent Plugins 1.0 released for VS Code, CLI, and app. Copilot Memory and Ollama support for JetBrains.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-08-14 | <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog\">→ Release Notes</a></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">Windsurf (Devin Desktop)</div>\n                    <span class=\"update-type bugfix\">Bugfix</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        v3.7.25: Performance improvements and authentication fixes. v3.7.16: UI improvements and sharing features.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-08-13 | <a href=\"https://docs.devin.ai/desktop/changelog\">→ Release Notes</a></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">Aider</div>\n                    <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        v0.86.0 - GPT-5 and Gemini 2.5 Flash Lite support. Grok-4 via xAI and OpenRouter. /clear command confirmation.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-08-09 | <a href=\"https://github.com/Aider-AI/aider/releases\">→ Release Notes</a></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">Codex CLI</div>\n                    <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Computer History for macOS, Agent Import functionality, Linux Desktop Preview, Daybreak security tiers with GPT-5.6 models.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-08-13 | <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/changelog\">→ Release Notes</a></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">Gemini CLI</div>\n                    <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        v0.54.0 - PR Automation with Antigravity agent runner, security enhancements, and caretaker triage improvements.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-08-06 | <a href=\"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\">→ Release Notes</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Technical Insights Section -->\n            <section class=\"column technical-insights\">\n                <h2>💡 Technical Insights (10)</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\">llm-gemini 0.33 released</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison | <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\">Blog</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Plugin adds support for Gemini 3.7 Flash with reasoning traces and tool-use capabilities.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-08-13</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">gemini</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">llm</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\">sqlite-utils 4.2.1 released</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison | <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\">Blog</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Quick fix for crashing bug due to missing dependency. Demonstrates importance of testing isolated installs.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-08-13</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">python</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">testing</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\">DeepSeek V4 Pro 0813 released</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison | <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\">Blog</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        New model with 1.7T parameters. Shows significant variation in reasoning levels across different outputs.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-08-12</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">deepseek</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">llm-release</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\">Stealing Reasoning Traces from LLM APIs</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison | <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\">Blog</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Research shows encrypted chain-of-thought from major providers could be extracted. All providers have now fixed this vulnerability.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-08-11</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">security</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">jailbreaking</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\">No lossless transformations of text</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison | <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\">Blog</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Critical insight: Every rewrite changes meaning. AI writing without your mental representation loses information.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-08-11</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">ai-writing</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">documentation</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\">Introducing Muse Glimmer</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison | <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\">Blog</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Meta's 30B Apache 2.0 model optimized for agentic tasks with strong benchmarks. Works well with 32GB+ RAM.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-08-10</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">meta</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">open-weights</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\">GitHub Models is now retired</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison | <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\">Blog</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Coding agent patterns made free tokens prohibitively expensive, leading to shutdown.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-08-09</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">github</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">pricing</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\">Auto mode default in Claude Code</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison | <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\">Blog</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Auto mode blocks 89% of harmful actions. Third-party eval found no successful attacks out of 720 attempts.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">2026-08-08</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">claude-code</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">security</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <footer>\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <p>Generated by Agent Code Daily - Powered by Claude Agent SDK</p>\n            <p>\n                <a href=\"#\">Previous Reports</a> |\n                <a href=\"#\">Methodology</a> |\n                <a href=\"#\">Subscribe</a> |\n                <a href=\"#\">GitHub</a>\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n</body>\n</html>",
